#. type: Title =
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/ev-charging-control/wallbox-comparison.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "OpenEMS: Wallbox control compared (OpenEMS, evcc, openWB)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/ev-charging-control/wallbox-comparison.adoc
msgid ""
"This page compares how **OpenEMS**, **evcc** and **openWB 2** charge "
"electric cars: which wallboxes they control, what charging modes there are, "
"how they take the home storage into account and how load management works. "
"The basis in each case is the source code (OpenEMS develop, evcc development "
"version “master”, openWB 2 “core” master). None of this has been tried out. "
"How the three systems exchange data **with each other** is on xref:user/"
"third-party/overview.adoc[Third-party systems on OpenEMS]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/ev-charging-control/wallbox-comparison.adoc
msgid ""
"Note on evcc: In the development version and in the published version "
"0.318.2 (latest version on 2026-11-01), the previous modes “PV” and "
"“Min{plus}PV” are combined into one mode **“Smart”**. The old names are "
"still accepted and converted to “Smart”."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/ev-charging-control/wallbox-comparison.adoc
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/third-party/overview.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "At a glance"
msgstr ""

