"| yes, about 20 drivers\n"
"| yes, very many (over 200 templates)\n"
"| only openWB devices, smartWB/EVSE-WiFi and a general MQTT charge point\n"
"| Vehicle state of charge (SoC) from the car\n"
"| no; vehicle only as characteristic data (capacity, minimum/maximum power)\n"
"| yes, around 70 vehicle templates (manufacturer clouds, etc.)\n"
"| yes, around 25 vehicle modules\n"
"| Immediate charging\n"
"| Fast Charging\n"
"| Now\n"
"| Instant charging\n"
"| PV surplus only\n"
"| PV Surplus\n"
"| Smart\n"
"| PV charging\n"
"| Minimum power {plus} surplus\n"
"| PV Surplus with guaranteed charge\n"
"| Smart with “always charge” (formerly Min{plus}PV)\n"
"| PV charging with minimum current\n"
"| Target by time\n"
"| via time schedule with minimum charging amount and energy optimizer\n"
"| Charging plan (target SoC or energy by time)\n"
"| Target charging\n"
